   "title": "Note",
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Swappable equipment\nLoad the **base** animation sheet (a body without the gear, e.g. from 10/16/17) and set its rows × columns. Load a picture of the **gear** (image 2) and describe it.\nOutput: `*_layer_sheet.png` has the same layout as the base sheet and only contains the gear pixels. Your engine draws base + armour layer + weapon layer per frame. Run once per item; combine them with *PF Composite Layers*.\nTip: generate the base as a plain 'underwear' version of the character so armour only ever adds pixels. Raise `tolerance` if body pixels leak into the layer."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
